Overall, by leveraging our RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, and past experience, we can design an AI solution that meets the client's requirements for intelligent assistance, improved written outputs, reduced processing times, and facilitated continuity of care, while ensuring explainability and consistency with HAS guidance on AI in healthcare.
